#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:2
msgid "Complete First-Run Setup"
msgstr "完成首次运行设置"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:4
msgid ""
"The setup wizard prepares the pieces that make Godot work useful. Every "
"step is optional and can be changed later in Settings, but configuring a "
"provider and Godot executable now makes the first session smoother."
msgstr "设置向导会准备好让 Godot 工作顺利进行所需的组件。每一步都是可选的，之后也可以在设置中修改；不过现在配置好供应商和 Godot 可执行文件，会让第一次会话更加顺畅。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:9
msgid "Setup steps"
msgstr "设置步骤"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:11
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "供应商"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:12
msgid ""
"Choose a provider, enter its API key, test the connection, and select a "
"model. The selected model becomes the default for new conversations."
msgstr "选择供应商，输入 API key，测试连接，然后选择模型。选定的模型会成为新对话的默认模型。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:15
msgid "Godot executable"
msgstr "Godot 可执行文件"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:16
msgid ""
"Select the Godot executable Studio should use for project validation, "
"launch actions, and version-aware documentation. Studio validates the "
"selected executable before saving it."
msgstr "选择 Studio 用于项目验证、启动操作和版本相关文档的 Godot 可执行文件。Studio 会在保存前验证选定的可执行文件。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:20
msgid "Offline documentation"
msgstr "离线文档"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:21
msgid ""
"Install an official ``godot-docs`` branch and enable offline search. This"
" lets the agent look up unfamiliar Godot APIs without depending on web "
"access. The download is optional and can be managed later in **Settings >"
" Documentation**."
msgstr "安装官方 ``godot-docs`` 分支并启用离线搜索。这样 agent 就能查找不熟悉的 Godot API，而不依赖网络访问。下载是可选的，之后可以在 **Settings > Documentation** 中管理。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:26
msgid "Godot Bridge"
msgstr "Godot Bridge"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select one or more Godot projects and install the bundled editor plugin. "
"Plugin changes may be staged until Godot closes. The full editor bridge "
"requires Godot 4.5 or newer."
msgstr "选择一个或多个 Godot 项目，并安装随附的编辑器插件。插件变更可能会暂存到 Godot 关闭后才应用。完整的编辑器桥接功能要求 Godot 4.5 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:32
msgid "If you skip a step"
msgstr "如果跳过某一步"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:34
msgid ""
"You can enter Studio after skipping optional setup. Use the corresponding"
" Settings page when you are ready:"
msgstr "跳过可选设置后仍然可以进入 Studio。准备好后，请使用对应的设置页面："

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:37
msgid "**Provider** and **Default model** configure model access."
msgstr "**Provider** 和 **Default model** 用于配置模型访问。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:38
msgid "**Godot Projects** manages project detection and the bundled plugin."
msgstr "**Godot Projects** 用于管理项目检测和随附插件。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Documentation** manages offline Godot documentation and its search "
"index."
msgstr "**Documentation** 用于管理离线 Godot 文档及其搜索索引。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/first-run.rst:41
msgid ""
"If a setup operation fails, record the version shown in **Settings > "
"About**, the step that failed, and the sanitized error message. Do not "
"include an API key or a custom MCP secret in a bug report."
msgstr "如果设置操作失败，请记录 **Settings > About** 中显示的版本、失败的步骤以及脱敏后的错误消息。提交错误报告时不要包含 API key 或自定义 MCP secret。"
